sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant In as Token embeddings
    participant Att as Self-attention
    participant KV as KV cache
    participant FF as Feed-forward
    participant Out as Logits
    In->>Att: vectors plus positions
    Att->>Att: each token builds a query, key and value
    Att->>KV: store this layer's keys and values
    Att->>Att: attend — weight every previous token by relevance
    Note over Att: this is the only place tokens see each other
    Att->>FF: contextualised vectors
    FF->>FF: expand, non-linearity, project back
    Note over In,FF: repeat for every layer — dozens to a hundred
    FF->>Out: probability over the whole vocabulary
    Out-->>In: sample one token, append, and go again
